---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout title="Refund &amp; Cancellation Policy" authRequired={false}>
  <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto">
    <h1 class="font-serif text-3xl text-espresso mb-2">Refund &amp; Cancellation Policy</h1>
    <p class="text-sm text-espresso/60 mb-8">Last updated: July 24, 2026</p>
    <div class="space-y-6 text-espresso/90 leading-relaxed">
      <section>
        <h2 class="font-serif text-xl text-espresso mb-2">Cancelling your subscription</h2>
        <p>You can cancel your AudioFile Premium subscription at any time from your Account page or via the Paddle customer portal. Cancellation stops future renewals — you won't be charged again, and you keep Premium access until the end of your current billing period.</p>
      </section>
      <section>
        <h2 class="font-serif text-xl text-espresso mb-2">Refunds</h2>
        <p>Premium subscriptions are sold by <strong>Paddle</strong>, which acts as the Merchant of Record. Paddle offers a refund window of <strong>14 days</strong> from the date of purchase or most recent renewal. If you request a refund within that window, Paddle will process a full refund at its discretion.</p>
        <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-1">
          <li>Requests made within 14 days of purchase or renewal are generally eligible for a full refund.</li>
          <li>Requests made after the 14-day window aren't eligible for a refund of the current period, but you can cancel to avoid future charges.</li>
          <li>Some refunds required by applicable consumer law may apply regardless of the window.</li>
        </ul>
      </section>
      <section>
        <h2 class="font-serif text-xl text-espresso mb-2">How to request a refund or cancellation</h2>
        <p>Email <a href="mailto:support@audiofile.app" class="underline">support@audiofile.app</a> with your account email and, if you have it, your Paddle order or transaction reference. We'll action cancellations immediately and route refund requests to Paddle.</p>
      </section>
      <section>
        <h2 class="font-serif text-xl text-espresso mb-2">Contact</h2>
        <p>Questions about billing? Email <a href="mailto:support@audiofile.app" class="underline">support@audiofile.app</a>.</p>
      </section>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>
